preConditionHook:
// Brooks's plain gap: this bar's whole RANGE is clear of the reference bar's
// range -- the low is above the high of the bar gapBarOffset bars ago (long),
// the high below its low (short). Strictly stronger than the catalog's
// CloseAbovePriorHigh, which only needs the closing price beyond that bar's high: a
// bar that trades back into the prior bar's range and still closes above it
// passes that rule and fails this one.
//
// gapBarOffset generalizes the neighbour test to a gap over any single earlier
// bar; at the default 1 it is the ordinary bar-to-bar gap. The comparison is
// STRICT, so a bar that merely touches the reference high does not count.
// Brooks states the test runs unchanged on daily bars.
